---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Pricing">
  <h1>Clear plans for growing teams</h1>
  <p>Choose a plan that matches your work today. All prices shown in USD; subscription billing is monthly.</p>
  <section aria-labelledby="starter-heading">
    <h2 id="starter-heading">Starter</h2>
    <p>Starter is $29.90 per month. Ideal for freelancers and teams beginning to centralize their operations.</p>
    <ul><li>Up to three team members</li><li>Project tracking and task assignments</li><li>Basic client management</li><li>Email support</li></ul>
    <a class="button" href="/faq">Starter plan questions</a>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="growth-heading">
    <h2 id="growth-heading">Growth</h2>
    <p>Growth is $69.90 per month and adds expanded reporting and team collaboration.</p>
    <ul><li>Up to fifteen team members</li><li>Advanced reporting dashboards</li><li>Reusable project templates</li><li>Priority email support</li></ul>
  </section>
  <h2>What happens when you upgrade?</h2>
  <p>Your projects and client records stay in place. Contact our team before switching billing arrangements.</p>
  <p>See the <a href="/faq">billing FAQ</a> for cancellation and renewal details.</p>
</Base>
